  indicatorID: market_button
  indicatorPosition: 0
  indicatorText: "Take note of your account balance, displayed on the bottom bar.
    This is the currency you'll use to purchase items. Spend it wisely to equip yourself
    with the tools needed for your tasks.\n\nInside the market, you'll find a variety
    of items, such as hacking software, gear upgrades, and special utilities. Each
    item includes a description to help you make the right choice.\n\nPlan your purchases
    carefully and prepare for the challenges ahead! Ready to explore? Let\u2019s
    dive in."
