    Here is the progress indicator, showing how many quests you
    have completed out of the total currently available.


    Click on the indicator
    to open the Quest Screen, where you can find details about available quests:
    their descriptions, objectives, rewards, and status. Select the quest you want
    to continue and get started!


    This simple tool helps you easily manage your
    adventure and track your progress.'
